# ADR 0188: `[ui] lang` switches the window live. Written from the settings
# screen, the host follows it, the catalogue is rebuilt and the page reloads
# into the new language — menu bar and `<html lang>` — with no restart; and
# it is saved, so the next start keeps it.
config lang = "en"
start
expect-dom lang en
expect-dom-has menubar File
key F11
expect-dom-has open settings
type language
key Return
expect-dom lang es
expect-dom-has menubar Archivo
shot spanish
restart
expect-dom lang es
expect-dom-has menubar Archivo
